dialog.timelineRegistryCorruptDetail:
Corrupt file: {{filePath}}

A quarantine copy was saved to: {{quarantinePath}}

Timeline writing stays blocked until you resolve this. To recover, either:
1. Restore a backup: replace the corrupt file with a valid copy (for example from the pre_migration_backup folder next to it, or from your own backup), or
2. Start over: delete the corrupt file. A fresh timeline will be created on the next event and the old branch history will be lost.

Restart the app after fixing the file.

dialog.timelineProtocolUnsupportedDetail:
Protocol schema: {{schema}}

Your mod and app versions are out of sync. Update both Voices of the Court (this app) and the VOTC mod to their latest matching versions, then restart the game and the app.

Timeline writing stays blocked for this data, but conversations, letters and battle reports continue to work without timeline branching.
